ss, the squeak of sneakers changing direction, and the swish of a perfect shot!\n \nDiana invites listeners to slow down, breathe, and move between moments of active play, and calm, meditative listening to build focus, teamwork, and self-belief on and off the court.\n\nThis card is filled with the authentic sounds of the game and mantras that have featured throughout Diana’s incredible career. Whether you’re preparing for game day, cooling down after practice, or just dreaming about basketball, listeners will find a coach, a mentor, and a soundtrack for the game, and for life!","maxAge":12,"minAge":6,"abridged":false,"accents":["US English"],"authors":["Yoto"],"copyrights":["© ℗ 2026 Yoto Ltd"],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/6F-AVt6DUBrpEA-tloGMtIeFWYFwJsVNw8urFnEERwE"},"genres":["learning-and-education","mindfulness-and-movement"],"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":2217,"fileSize":35865284,"hasStreams":false},"narrators":["Diana Taurasi"],"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2026-10-30T11:33:02.167Z"}},"slug":"MD1anWUFy2OAx8ASkXZCJ","title":"Basketball Sounds: Game Ready with Diana Taurasi","userId":"yoto","cardId":"gCnla","createdAt":"2026-01-06T09:09:25.360Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-30T11:33:04.756Z","clubAvailability":[{"store":"uk"},{"store":"ca"},{"store":"us"},{"store":"eu"},{"store":"au"}],"sortkey":"#basketball-sounds-game-ready-with-Diana-Taurasi"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":true,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":true,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":false}}